addons/WeaponSwingTimer-SixxFix/

# Claude Code: CLAUDE.md is tracked (shared rules); CLAUDE.local.md is local-only (personal overrides)
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/

# VS Code: ignore personal settings, but share the recommended extension list
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

